From: Smartisan ODIN mainline porting effort
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] lk2nd: go to fastboot instead of booting the stale android image

When lk2nd fails to boot from any file system it currently just logs
"Reverting to android boot." and returns, letting aboot fall through to
boot_linux_from_mmc().

On ODIN that fallback is harmful. The 'boot' partition still carries the
stock android boot images -- measured on the running device, there are
four ANDROID! headers in /dev/mmcblk0p21, at byte offsets 0, 271236,
524288 and 787184. One of them gets booted, finds no system partition and
resets; lk2nd then runs again and repeats. The device reboot-loops until
someone holds power+vol-down, which makes the flash/debug cycle impossible
to automate.

Fix it in three places:

- lk2nd/boot/boot.c: set boot_into_fastboot once we fall off the end of
  lk2nd_scan_devices(). Reaching that point already means nothing was
  booted -- a successful boot jumps into the kernel and never returns --
  so no return value needs to be threaded through.

- app/aboot/aboot.c (normal_boot): re-check boot_into_fastboot right after
  lk2nd_boot() and jump to the fastboot label. The existing check happens
  *before* lk2nd_boot() runs, so without this the flag would be ignored
  and we would still fall through to the android image.

- app/aboot/aboot.c (cmd_continue): same story for the "Continue" menu
  entry. It calls lk2nd_boot() and then unconditionally
  boot_linux_from_mmc(); without this, picking "Continue" from the menu
  with no bootable fs would boot the stale image and loop.

History: this change existed briefly as 0005 but was dropped in b9b5899
when the tree moved to lk2nd 21.0, and was never restored when we went
back to 23.1 -- which is why the reboot loop came back. The 0005 slot has
since been taken by the ext4 extents patch, so this is 0007.

Generated against lk2nd 23.1.

---
diff --git a/app/aboot/aboot.c b/app/aboot/aboot.c
index b44a5c2..9196f2d 100644
--- a/app/aboot/aboot.c
+++ b/app/aboot/aboot.c
@@ -4672,6 +4672,14 @@ void cmd_continue(const char *arg, void *data, unsigned sz)
 #if WITH_LK2ND_BOOT
 		if (!boot_into_recovery)
 			lk2nd_boot();
+
+		/*
+		 * 菜单里的 "Continue" 也走这条：lk2nd 没引导起任何东西时，
+		 * 同样别去引导 boot 分区里残留的原厂 Android 镜像（理由见
+		 * lk2nd/boot/boot.c）。直接返回，fastboot 主循环会重新显示菜单。
+		 */
+		if (boot_into_fastboot)
+			return;
 #endif
 		boot_linux_from_mmc();
 	}
@@ -5655,6 +5663,18 @@ normal_boot:
 #if WITH_LK2ND_BOOT
 		if (!boot_into_recovery)
 			lk2nd_boot();
+
+		/*
+		 * lk2nd 没能从任何文件系统引导起来时会置 boot_into_fastboot
+		 * （见 lk2nd/boot/boot.c 的 lk2nd_scan_devices() 末尾）。
+		 *
+		 * 这里的重新判断**不能省**：外面那个 if (!boot_into_fastboot)
+		 * 在 lk2nd_boot() **之前**就判过了，不重判就会继续往下走，
+		 * 去引导 boot 分区里残留的原厂 Android 镜像 —— 它起不来就复位，
+		 * 于是设备在 lk2nd 与那个镜像之间反复重启。
+		 */
+		if (boot_into_fastboot)
+			goto fastboot;
 #endif
 
 		if (target_is_emmc_boot())
diff --git a/lk2nd/boot/boot.c b/lk2nd/boot/boot.c
index 7f37c61..769d697 100644
--- a/lk2nd/boot/boot.c
+++ b/lk2nd/boot/boot.c
@@ -5,6 +5,7 @@
 #include <lib/bio.h>
 #include <lib/fs.h>
 #include <list.h>
+#include <stdbool.h>
 #include <stdlib.h>
 #include <target.h>
 
@@ -13,6 +14,14 @@
 
 #include "boot.h"
 
+/*
+ * aboot.c 里的全局标志（app/aboot/aboot.c 顶部 `bool boot_into_fastboot`）。
+ * lk2nd 没能从任何文件系统引导起来时置位，让 aboot 直接进 fastboot，
+ * 而不是回退去引导 boot 分区里残留的原厂 Android 镜像。
+ * 说明见下面 lk2nd_scan_devices() 的末尾。
+ */
+extern bool boot_into_fastboot;
+
 #ifndef LK2ND_BOOT_MIN_SIZE
 #define LK2ND_BOOT_MIN_SIZE (16 * 1024 * 1024)
 #endif
@@ -60,7 +69,23 @@ static void lk2nd_scan_devices(void)
 		lk2nd_try_extlinux(mountpoint);
 	}
 
-	dprintf(INFO, "boot: Bootable file system not found. Reverting to android boot.\n");
+	/*
+	 * 能走到这里，就意味着**什么都没引导起来** —— 引导成功是要跳进内核的，
+	 * 不会返回。
+	 *
+	 * 上游的默认行为是打一行日志就返回，让 aboot 继续去引导 boot 分区里的
+	 * Android 镜像。在 ODIN 上这条回退是**有害的**：实测 boot 分区
+	 * （/dev/mmcblk0p21）里现在还留着 4 个原厂 ANDROID! 镜像，偏移分别在
+	 * 0 / 271236 / 524288 / 787184。boot_linux_from_mmc() 会真的把其中一个
+	 * 引导起来，那个原厂内核找不到 system 分区就复位 —— 于是设备在
+	 * "lk2nd 亮屏 → 原厂安卓内核 → 复位"之间反复重启，只能人工按住电源键
+	 * 打断，整个刷机/调试流程没法自动跑完。
+	 *
+	 * 改为置 boot_into_fastboot，由 aboot 跳到 fastboot 标签
+	 * （见 app/aboot/aboot.c 里 lk2nd_boot() 之后那个判断）。
+	 */
+	dprintf(INFO, "boot: Bootable file system not found. Reverting to fastboot.\n");
+	boot_into_fastboot = true;
 }
 
 /**
